      <b>2.</b> 
      In the <b>Inspector</b> window, in the <b>Rigidbody</b> component, increase
      the mass to ensure it topples the block structure when it collides.


      <b>3.</b> 
      Enter Play mode and watch the blocks fly!


      <b>Note:</b>  Remember to
      save your scene often with <b>Ctrl+S</b> (macOS: <b>Cmd+S</b>).'
